export anchor TrueBlackStyle:
    number: 226
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: True black
    idea: Pure black for OLED screens with white type, razor-thin 1px separators and no tint anywhere, so the only colour on the screen is the status of a project.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #000000, the page, every surface and the style sheet
        separator: #262626, 1px rules and the progress track
        white: #ffffff, text, figures, progress, this week bars, the primary button and focus
        grey: #a3a3a3, labels, meta and times
        dim: #737373, last week bars, link underlines and the secondary button edge
        ok: #4ade80, the On track word and check circle, the only green
        risk: #facc15, the At risk word and triangle, the only yellow
        bad: #ff7a7a, Behind, the overdue line and figure, the only red
    type:
        Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, then system-ui. Base 15px at 1.5.
        The greeting is 44px at 300 tracked minus 0.03em, the figures 52px
        at 200, project names 18px at 400, section labels 13px at 500 in
        grey, and status words 13px.
    layout:
        A slim top line ruled below holds the bold wordmark, six text links
        with Home white and underlined, an underline-only search field, a
        square white New project button with black text, a bare bell and an
        outlined round MO disc with Mara Okafor. Below, two columns split by
        a 1px rule. The 400px left column is today. It shows the date, Good
        morning, Mara. in light 44px type, a red clock line reading 4 tasks
        are overdue, the four figures as a two by two grid of huge thin
        numbers over small labels split by hairlines, and the chart with
        thin needle bars, grey for last week and white for this week, over
        the two totals. The right column lists Projects as rows with the
        name, category, percent with tasks, due date and the status word,
        and under each row a full-width 1px track with a 3px white progress
        line that doubles as the row separator. Activity follows as a ruled
        list with times on the right. Below 860px the nav and search take
        their own rows and the columns stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit with generous air. 40px gutters, 18px above each row, 48 to 56px between blocks.
    density: Low to medium. Two columns, a today column on the left and the work on the right.
    corners: Square everywhere. Only the avatar is round.
    borders: 1px #262626 separators between figures, columns and activity rows, nothing heavier. Fields are a single underline.
    shadows: None. Pure black cannot carry a shadow.
    icons:
        Thin line icons at 1.25 stroke, 16px, used only for status, search,
        the bell and overdue. Status is a check circle, a triangle or a
        crossed square with the word.
    focus: A 2px white outline offset 3px.
    tone: Terse and calm, such as Good morning, Mara. and Projects and Activity.
